  Description: 'Stronghold - intensity 4 of Haul: eighteen crusted bales out by the membrane, and two
    Windmills. The standard 1200 u cell with its nucleus (~392 u), no environment, no flora
    and no fauna. The field (18 bales, 3,186 prisms of 7 u, 2,034 of them shielded crust) is
    laid by HaulController. 2 omni crystals respawn inside the nucleus (the scene''s
    CrystalManager). Frenzy sits 25% above the full arena (13,986 prisms, 3,943,998 volume).
    Authored by Tools/Build/author_haul_assets.py - re-run it rather than hand-editing.'
